  "body": "Whether you are looking for a permanent family home, a weekend escape or your own slice of paradise, this is an opportunity to secure a substantial coastal home in a much loved Red Beach setting.\r\n\r\nThis spacious, north facing five bedroom family home captures spectacular beach views from every level and offers the opportunity to secure your own memorable coastal retreat.\r\n\r\nGenerous living spaces and excellent family accommodation are complemented by extensive storage, extra-large garaging and ample off-street parking, with room for the boat too. Enjoy relaxed living, long summer days and the very best of the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nThe beach lifestyle is right at home here.\r\n\r\nAccess from the garden path leads to the beach walkway, making morning walks, swims, paddleboarding and carefree family beach days wonderfully accessible. This is a setting where the coast becomes part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nMove in and enjoy this home as it is, with scope to create a beach house that reflects your own style while taking full advantage of the exceptional position, views and location.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the views, the beach lifestyle and the potential for your family to begin making memories here to treasure for a lifetime.",
